sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as 유저
    participant LC as LoginController
    participant TS as ITokenStorage (Keystore)
    participant HR as HttpRequest
    participant API as Server
    participant GS as GameSession
    participant SL as SceneLoader

    U->>LC: 타이틀 터치
    LC->>TS: TryLoad(out refreshToken)
    alt 저장된 리프레시 토큰 있음 (자동 로그인)
        LC->>HR: AuthApi.Refresh(refreshToken)
        HR->>API: POST api/auth/refresh
        API-->>LC: accessToken, refreshToken (재발급)
    else 토큰 없음 또는 401
        LC->>TS: Clear()
        U->>LC: 이메일 로그인 / Google 로그인
        LC->>HR: AuthApi.Login / GoogleLogin(idToken)
        HR->>API: POST api/auth/login
        API-->>LC: accessToken, refreshToken
    end
    LC->>GS: SetLogin(accessToken, refreshToken)
    GS->>TS: Save(refreshToken)
    LC->>HR: PlayerApi.GetMe()
    HR->>API: GET api/players/me
    opt 플레이어 없음 (404, 첫 로그인)
        U->>LC: 닉네임 입력
        LC->>HR: PlayerApi.Create(nickname)
        HR->>API: POST api/players
    end
    API-->>LC: PlayerResponse
    LC->>GS: SetUser(player.ToUser())
    LC->>SL: Load(LobbyScene)
